All 6 features are implemented and tested. Here's a summary of the changes:

**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now:
- Reads `X-API-Key` header (defaults to `None` if absent)
- Raises `HTTPException(status_code=401)` if missing or not in `VALID_API_KEYS`
- Returns the mapped username on success

**`app/main.py`** — all new/changed endpoints:

| Endpoint | Auth | Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| `GET /tasks` | No | Query params: `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` (all optional, combinable) + `page` (default 1), `page_size` (default 20, max 100) |
| `POST /tasks` | **Required** (401 if missing/invalid) | Validates `project_id` exists (404 if not), auto-generates ID via `max(id)+1`, returns 201 with created task |
| `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` | **Required** | Partial update via `TaskUpdate` with `exclude_unset=True` — only provided fields change. Returns 404 if not found |
| `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` | **Required** | Removes task from list. Returns 204 on success, 404 if not found |

